    "Is this tool free to use?": "工具免费吗？",
    "Yes, the 360 Photo to Video Generator is 100% free with unlimited exports. You can upload any 360 panorama, customize duration and aspect ratio, and download high-definition video clips immediately.": "360° 照片转视频工具免费，可上传全景、自定义时长与比例并下载高清视频，导出次数不限。",
    "PANORAMA CAMERA PAN • LOCAL VIDEO EXPORT": "全景相机平移 • 本地视频导出",
