    "Turn a 360° Panorama into a Panning Video": "将 360° 全景变成平移展示视频",
    "Animate a 2:1 panorama of your showroom, store or virtual environment into a panning showcase video. Free local MP4 or WebM export, depending on browser support.": "将展厅、店铺或虚拟环境的 2:1 全景制作成展示视频。浏览器本地免费导出 MP4 或 WebM，具体格式取决于浏览器支持。",
    "Convert a 2:1 equirectangular panorama into a panning video for social feeds, portfolios and store showcases. Free local MP4 or WebM export, depending on browser support.": "将 2:1 全景制作成社交动态、作品集和店铺展示视频。免费本地导出 MP4 或 WebM，格式取决于浏览器支持。",
    "16:9 • 9:16 (TikTok) • 1:1 Formats": "16:9 • 9:16（TikTok）• 1:1 比例",
