    "What is an AI Skybox Generator and what formats does it produce?": "¿Qué es un generador de skybox con IA y qué formatos produce?",
    "An AI Skybox Generator generates immersive 360° spherical or cubic virtual backgrounds for games, VR simulations, and 3D scenes from text prompts. 360 Panorama Viewer outputs both standard 2:1 equirectangular spherical textures and 6 rectilinear cube faces (+X, -X, +Y, -Y, +Z, -Z) ready for immediate engine import.": "Genera fondos 360° para juegos, VR y escenas 3D a partir de texto. Exporta texturas equirectangulares 2:1 y seis caras de cubo (+X, -X, +Y, -Y, +Z, -Z); configura la importación según tu motor.",
    "Is 360 Panorama Viewer a direct alternative to Blockade Labs Skybox AI?": "¿Es una alternativa a Blockade Labs Skybox AI?",
    "How do I use the generated skybox in Unity?": "¿Cómo uso el skybox generado en Unity?",
    "In Unity, create a new Material and set its Shader to \"Skybox > 6 Sided\" (for cubemap slices) or \"Skybox > Panoramic\" (for the 2:1 equirectangular PNG). Assign your textures, then drag the Material into your Lighting Settings under Environment > Skybox Material.": "Crea un Material en Unity y elige «Skybox > 6 Sided» para seis caras o «Skybox > Panoramic» para PNG 2:1. Asigna las texturas y selecciona el material en Lighting Settings > Environment > Skybox Material.",
    "Can I generate skyboxes for Unreal Engine 5?": "¿Puedo generar skyboxes para Unreal Engine 5?",
