    "Unity Skybox Setup": "Unity-Skybox einrichten",
    "Download the 6-sided cubemap ZIP from 360 Panorama Viewer.": "Lade das ZIP mit sechs Flächen von 360 Panorama Viewer herunter.",
    "In Unity, create a new Material named `Skybox_Custom`.": "Erstelle in Unity ein Material namens `Skybox_Custom`.",
